# ==========================================
# MATHEMATICAL EQUATION & COMPLEMENT CONCEPT:
# ==========================================
# 1. Humein pata hai ke: 
#    Number_1 + Number_2 = Target
# 
# 2. Agar humein Number_1 (yaani current number) pata hai aur Target bhi pata hai, 
#    toh Number_2 nikalne ke liye equation ko rearrange kar lete hain:
#    Number_2 = Target - Number_1
#
# 3. Isi ko "Complement" kehte hain:
#    Yahi jo Number_2 hai, jo hamare current number ka bacha hua hissa hai 
#    jo target tak pahunchne ke liye zaroori hai, isko programming ki zaban mein 
#    complement (yaani poora karne wala) kehte hain.
# ==========================================

nums = [2, 7, 11, 15]
target = 9
seen = {}

for i, num in enumerate(nums):
    # Target mein se current number minus karke complement nikal rahe hain
    complement = target - num
    
    # Check kar rahe hain ke kya yeh complement pehle se dictionary mein maujud hai
    if complement in seen:
        print([seen[complement] + 1, i + 1])
        break
        
    # Agar nahi hai, toh current number aur uska index store kar lo
    seen[num] = i